      "After studying this unit, students will be able to:",
      "Define organic chemistry and organic compounds. (Remembering)",
      "Explain why there is such a diversity and magnitude of organic compounds. (Analyzing) Classify organic compounds on structural basis. (Analyzing)",
      "Explain the use of coal as a source of both aromatic and aliphatic hydrocarbons. (Understanding) Explain the use of plants as a source of organic compounds. (Understanding) Explain that organic compounds are also synthesized in the laboratory. (Understanding) Define functional groups and homologous series. (Remembering)",
      "R",
