        "sciNote": "Write detail answers of the following questions.\n1. (a).\n(b). How would\nclassification of carbohydrate.\n2. (a). Describe various classes of protein along with examples.\n(b). Enlist the properties of protein.\nyou evaluate the role of various carbohydrates in health and diseases?\n307\nNOT FOR SALE\n3. (a). What are lipids? Explain the basis of classification of lipids.\n(b). Discuss in detail the structure and nutritional and biological importance of lipids.\n(a). Explain the role of inhibitors of enzyme catalysed reactions.\n(b). Identify the different structural components of DNA and RNA.\n5. (a). Assess the role of enzyme as biocatalyst and relate this role to various functions\nsuch as digestion of food.\n(b). Evaluate the factors that affect enzyme activity such as effect of temperature\nand pH.\n6. (a). Why zinc is important for human being?\n(b). State the medical problems that may relate to calcium and phosphorus.\nProject\nTake 250cm3 milk in a beaker. Gently warm the milk (not boil), add small amount of lemon juice or vinegar (acetic acid) in it and observe it. Report your observation by answering the following questions.\n1. What happen to the state of the milk? 2. Is there any chemical change occur in it? 3. Does the change in pH affect the milk? 4. Name the product obtained during the process. 5. Is this product has any nutritional importance?\n6. Name some products in which it is used.\nawaz e in\n308\n26\nNOT FORSALE\nUnit 22\nB"
